Implemented the two accepted fixes only:

- Invalid `prompt.submit` dispositions now attempt `image.detach` for every attached image, suppress detach failures, keep prompt admission held until cleanup finishes, and raise the original invalid-disposition `GatewayError`.
- Clipboard paste now sends all clipboard files through the same `intakeFiles` validation path as picker/drop, while text-only paste remains untouched.

Added regressions:

- `tests/unit/test_minds_sessions.py::test_invalid_prompt_disposition_detaches_all_images_before_next_prompt`
- `tests/e2e/test_chat_images.py::test_mixed_clipboard_files_accept_image_and_show_standard_rejection`

